        "TileImage": "$($repository 4ac262f0-2ef8-4205-8c16-37f1c8c12b81).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. A man known only as &apos;Julian&apos; has intel on current ICA facilities that he plans to leak to the public. As you can imagine, this is not something we want to happen, Julian must be eliminated, or else he may leak his intel.\r\rIn addition, he has enlisted the help of Jackie Carrington, former supermodel,  professional spy, and Julian&apos;s lover. Carrington is already has a registered ICA hit, and is going to help Julian cover his tracks once he leaks the info. \r\rHappy hunting, 47.",
